# Paper trading needs nothing here: no exchange key, no wallet, no API key.
#
# Only if config.yaml sets forecaster.backend: "api" (billed per token; the default "claude_code" uses the
# Claude subscription already signed in on this PC):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Optional uptime ping, same idea as the stock trader's heartbeat (a healthchecks-style URL):
# HEALTHCHECK_URL=
#
# Real money is not implemented. When it is, the exchange key does NOT go in this file: see docs/GO_LIVE.md.
